+| size:colossal (supported, not pooled) | 6422x3427 | 343,256 | 1,376,342 | 302 | 1,237 | 13,730 | 55 | 2,411 ms |
+
+The 20 sampled pool entries range from 1050x560 (9,170 cells, 5-15 rooms) to giant. pool:17 has 19 pixel components and pool:18 has 7 (pits and islands); spawns are always in one component and every `ValidatedGoal` is in the requester's component.
+
+Index probe (scratch `seg_probe.nim`: one room-bounded Dijkstra per (room, portal) over legal 8 px moves; the legality mask build is included in the time):
+
+| Map | (room, portal) Dijkstras | Portal-field cells | Max room cells | Portal pairs with a segment | Pairs unreachable inside the room | Segment cells total | Avg segment cells | Max chain cells | Index build | BodyMap build (same run) |
+|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
+| pool:1 | 738 | 1,695,732 | 12,846 | 4,261 | 113 | 224,822 | 52 | 147 | 231 ms | 499 ms |
+| pool:2 | 482 | 1,958,462 | 15,350 | 3,940 | 39 | 256,077 | 64 | 202 | 283 ms | 497 ms |
+| pool:5 | 424 | 1,278,175 | 18,885 | 2,482 | 119 | 105,692 | 42 | 213 | 189 ms | 479 ms |
+| pool:12 | 226 | 811,402 | 8,520 | 1,827 | 45 | 107,110 | 58 | 146 | 108 ms | 211 ms |
