+  <section id="review">
+    <h2>10 · Review record</h2>
+    <ul class="key-points">
+      <li>Three Codex rounds: round 1 fact checks and simplifications, round 2 REVISE with seven corrections, round 3 GO with three implementation-proof notes.</li>
+      <li>Everything accepted is in §4 and §5 above. Nothing stays as a dissent.</li>
